{"subject_id": "9021399", "chunk_id": "db0c5bd87a6e", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 37, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-09T23:15:04", "source_id": "detail_9021399_0", "order": 1, "used_fallback": false, "title": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "text": "HBM（高带宽存储器）是一款应用于CPU/GPU的新型内存芯片，HBM是将很多个DDR芯片堆叠在一起后和GPU封装在一起，实现大容量、高位宽的DDR组合阵列。", "uid": "ed5c92f504d2"}
{"subject_id": "9021399", "chunk_id": "366f54dcc3b2", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 38, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-09T23:15:04", "source_id": "detail_9021399_0", "order": 2, "used_fallback": false, "title": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "text": "HBM通过采用TSV技术突破内存带宽与容量瓶颈，是新一代的DRAM解决方案", "uid": "b2bb6e6a91b5"}
{"subject_id": "9021399", "chunk_id": "0c137ef2535a", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 39, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-09T23:15:04", "source_id": "detail_9021399_0", "order": 3, "used_fallback": false, "title": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "text": "与传统内存技术相比，HBM具有更高带宽、更大容量、更低功耗、更小尺寸，HBM突破了内存带宽与容量瓶颈，让更大的模型、更多的参数留在离核心计算更近的地方，从而减少存储解决方案带来的延迟，是新一代的DRAM解决方案。", "uid": "92d326b54b32"}
{"subject_id": "9021399", "chunk_id": "3ef641f4839b", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 40, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-09T23:15:04", "source_id": "detail_9021399_0", "order": 4, "used_fallback": false, "title": "HBM存储产业链介绍：", "text": "全球DRAM三巨头垄断HBM市场，SK海力士占据半壁江山。HBM市场主要被全球前三大DRAM厂商占据，根据TrendForce的数据，2022年SK海力士HBM市占率为50%，三星的市占率约40%、美光的市占率约10%。", "uid": "0b3ae0cf1884"}
